tic spaces, practice parkour\u2011style traversal, and experiment with different movement techniques as you explore with friends. The game emphasizes expressive motion, social play, and a fluid movement system that rewards momentum and precision.\n\nWhether you\u2019re climbing to new heights, swinging across gaps, or racing through the environment with others, Monkey Chaos VR delivers a fun, fast, and chaotic movement playground built for nonstop action.", "short_description": "Monkey Chaos VR is a fast\u2011paced movement sandbox built around physical locomotion. Players run, climb, swing, and vault through dynamic environments using real motion and skill\u2011based traversal. Every action is driven by your body, creating an energetic and expressive movement experience.\n\nExplore chaotic spaces with friends, experiment with parkour\u2011style movement, and master advanced techniques as you navigate the environment. Monkey Chaos VR focuses on freeform play, social interaction, and hig"}]}, "developer_name": "VELZ LLC GAMES", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1h5Lirb1fRwIuYkcrKiuIslwwoVwqDf37BDqGuCpu_0k/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.4kiiwg7lt2i5", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VELZ", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1h5Lirb1fRwIuYkcrKiuIslwwoVwqDf37BDqGuCpu_0k/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.4kiiwg7lt2i5", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input